# Binaries and test artifacts
/bin/
/dist/
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# `go build ./cmd/<name>` without -o drops the binary here at the module
# root (named after the package dir). Builds should go to ./bin via
# `task build`; these guard against the stray-at-root accident.
/meshkey
/meshmon

# Editor droppings
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
